cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: eeg-seizures
abstract: Seizure detection on clinical scalp EEG in the SzCORE event format. A line-length detector (Esteller et
  al. 2001) on the 19 10-20 electrodes in common average reference at 256 Hz (bipolar-only recordings kept bipolar),
  normalised to a trailing 5-minute baseline, or a user-supplied ONNX model; detections written as SzCORE event
  files and scored with timescoring against annotated seizures (event-based sensitivity, precision, F1 and false
  detections per day). Detections are candidates for expert review.
